% The fields of a listing that name what the product is
"item type" is a field that names the kind,
    as stated in the listing format, confer "Item Type (64 listings): the kind of product in the seller's words".
"tops type" is a field that names the kind,
    as stated in the listing format, confer "Tops Type (13 listings): the kind of top".
"fabric type" is a field that names the fabric,
    as stated in the listing format, confer "Fabric Type (38 listings): the name of the fabric".

